zainab ali akber ke jine ki dua mango<br>
bachjaye mera bacha tum iski dua mango<br>
<br>
1. zainab yeh pisar meri ankhon ki basarat hain<br>
reh jaye nazar meri tum iski dua mango<br>
<br>
2. iss laal ki aye zainab sehre ki tamanna thi<br>
mit jaye na yeh armaan tum iski dua mango<br>
<br>
3. koniyon ke bal chal kar pounchey lash-e-akber par<br>
laila kahi dekhna le fizza yeh duaa mango<br>
<br>
4. shay ne kaha aye akber kaise main ijazat doo<br>
pehle jake zainab se marne ki reza mango<br>
<br>
5. daaman nahi chodti thi sakina ali akber ka<br>
behna teri marjaye pehle yeh dua mango<br>
<br>
6. rakhte the uthate the mayyat ali akber ki<br>
khaimey tak pounch jaye bacho yeh dua mango<br>
<br>
7. soghra kaha karti thi aksar aye watan walon<br>
bhaiya mera lout aaye sab milke dua mango